{"id": "85919", "name": "שברים אלגבריים – סכום 1/v + 1/v² + 1/v³ כשבר אחד (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Write</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{1}{{CT:0}}+\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^2}+\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^3}. \\]</p><p>as a single fraction.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Make the denominator the same, then collect terms</b><br>The common denominator is the highest power <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}^3\\)</span>. Expand the first fraction by <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}^2\\)</span> and the second by <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\frac{1}{{CT:0}} + \\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^2} + \\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^3} &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\left(\\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\cdot\\frac{{{CT:0}}^2}{{{CT:0}}^2}\\right)+ \\left(\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^2}\\cdot\\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:0}}\\right) + \\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^3},\\quad(\\mbox{make the denominator the same})\\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:0}}^2}{{{CT:0}}^3}+\\frac{{CT:0}}{{{CT:0}}^3}+\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^3},\\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:0}}^2 + {{CT:0}} + 1}{{{CT:0}}^3}.\\qquad(\\mbox{collect terms}) \\end{array} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "x", "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta", "v"], "nvariants": 3}